  "hidden_text": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "This short survey helps your TA monitor group dynamics and support you during the labs. Please answer honestly about how your group is working together. Your responses will remain anonymous unless you choose to include your name. The survey is worth 5 points toward your lab grade and is graded only on completion, not on the content of your answers. Use this as a chance to raise any concerns to your TA (for example, if group members are not contributing to the lab report) or if you would like your TA to address anything during your lab meetings."
    },
